<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:00:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>华尔街大肆进行套利交易</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/wall-street-se-vuelve-mas-cauteloso-con-el-carry-trade-mwxrpht6</link><description>行动主要针对 20% 的抵抗运动、干预和政治危机。啊霍拉，la volatilidad obliga a repensar una de las maniobras favorites del Mercado。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/wall-street-se-vuelve-mas-cauteloso-con-el-carry-trade-mwxrpht6'&gt;华尔街大肆进行套利交易&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Wall Street se vuelve más cauteloso con el carry trade&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/wall-street-se-vuelve-mas-cauteloso-con-el-carry-trade-mwxrpht6</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:29:26 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>跨石油公司警告持续经营风险未决债务豁免</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/trans-oil-warns-of-going-concern-risk-pending-debt-waiver</link><description>Trans-Oil 集团在违反一项重要出口设施的财务契约后尚未获得豁免，这增加了这家农产品公司的流动性压力。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/trans-oil-warns-of-going-concern-risk-pending-debt-waiver'&gt;跨石油公司警告持续经营风险未决债务豁免&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Trans-Oil Warns of Going-Concern Risk Pending Debt Waiver&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/trans-oil-warns-of-going-concern-risk-pending-debt-waiver</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:39:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于波动性打击金属，铜价从今年最低点反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals</link><description>尽管人们对人工智能繁荣和相关工业金属需求的持久性仍存疑虑，但铜价从 11 个月低点上涨逾 3%，追随科技股的涨幅。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals'&gt;由于波动性打击金属，铜价从今年最低点反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Copper Rebounds From Lowest This Year as Volatility Grips Metals&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:01:10 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Global Stocks Climb as AI Trade Mounts a Comeback: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着中国竞争对手的推进，Stellantis 将暂停更多欧洲工厂</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/stellantis-to-pause-more-europe-plants-as-chinese-rivals-advance</link><description>Stellantis NV 计划在未来几周内在欧洲进一步停工，因为该汽车制造商正在努力应对日益激烈的竞争、高成本和某些车型需求疲软的问题。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/stellantis-to-pause-more-europe-plants-as-chinese-rivals-advance'&gt;随着中国竞争对手的推进，Stellantis 将暂停更多欧洲工厂&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stellantis to Pause More Europe Plants as Chinese Rivals Advance&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/stellantis-to-pause-more-europe-plants-as-chinese-rivals-advance</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:49:16 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>